  "description": "GroupDocs.Total for .NET is a document processing SDK for .NET developers. It consolidates all GroupDocs .NET document processing SDKs into one NuGet package, so you can manage licenses and dependencies with minimal overhead.\n\nThis package includes:\n\n* GroupDocs.Annotation for .NET - 24.12\n* GroupDocs.Assembly for .NET - 25.6\n* GroupDocs.Comparison for .NET - 25.8\n* GroupDocs.Conversion for .NET - 25.9\n* GroupDocs.Editor for .NET - 25.7\n* GroupDocs.Merger for .NET - 25.9\n* GroupDocs.Metadata for .NET - 25.8\n* GroupDocs.Parser for .NET - 25.8\n* GroupDocs.Redaction for .NET - 25.9\n* GroupDocs.Search for .NET - 25.9\n* GroupDocs.Signature for .NET - 25.6\n* GroupDocs.Viewer for .NET - 25.9\n* GroupDocs.Watermark for .NET - 25.2\n\nCheck the documentation at:\nhttps://docs.groupdocs.com/total/net/\n\nFree support at our free support forum:\nhttps://forum.groupdocs.com/\n\nPriority support provided at paid support helpdesk:\nhttps://helpdesk.groupdocs.com/",
